{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】在灣仔、筲箕灣的天主教堂亦有悼念彌撒。</p>\n<p>灣仔天主教聖母聖衣堂的彌撒，教友讀出168位宏福苑亡者姓名，眾人其後鞠躬又頌唱聖詩，並由神父唸出經文，帶領教友為亡者禱告。</p>\n<p>而筲箕灣聖十字架堂同樣有悼念彌撒，有教友於門外的聖母像獻花，教堂坐滿人，由神父帶領下頌唱聖詩。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:23:55.096592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:26.702602+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:26.702602+00:00","content_hash":"cc530d6c8961a344919d4cd8f5904c470c57b40bc4f8e18152485e4f45891512","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}